{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26148","headline":"赋得骐骥长鸣 · 陈去疾","name":"赋得骐骥长鸣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骐骥忻知己，嘶鸣忽异常。\n积悲摅怨抑，一举彻穹苍。\n迹类三年鸟，心驰五达庄。\n何言从蹇踬，今日逐腾骧。\n牛皁休维絷，天衢恣陆梁。\n向非逢伯乐，谁足见其长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈去疾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}